# Phase 1 rework result — readiness and follower convergence

## Changes

- `packages/music-core/session/config.ts`: added a guarded probe operation that returns `starting` only with filesystem evidence of a live startup marker; it grants no cleanup authority.
- `packages/music-core/session/client.ts`:
  - Followers now retry a retryable reset only while that independent live marker remains; malformed/unmarked peers remain terminal `occupied`.
  - Replaced chunk-local stderr parsing with bounded incremental byte framing. Readiness and daemon diagnostics now survive split lines; retained diagnostics are capped at 512 bytes and exclude non-daemon output.
  - Preserved typed early-exit details (exit code, signal, bounded diagnostic) and the readiness gate before probing a launched daemon.
- `packages/music-core/tests/session-client.test.ts`: added split-prefix/split-line readiness and diagnostic coverage, runtime selection coverage, readiness-window coverage, and post-ready occupied-peer coverage.

