## Residual risks

The production fallback retains only daemon-prefixed stderr lines and does not expose arbitrary child output. A retryable reset without a live startup marker remains terminal occupied. An owned stale test daemon from the prior failed gate was terminated with SIGTERM; final socket/marker cleanup was confirmed.
